---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy - Data Protection & GDPR Compliance"
  description="How CryptoPulse collects, safeguards, and respects user personal data in compliance with GDPR, CCPA, and global privacy standards."
  canonicalUrl="https://cryptopulse.news/privacy-policy"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-20">
    <header class="mb-10 pb-6 border-b border-slate-800">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-white tracking-tight mb-3">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Effective Date: September 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
      <div class="bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white">1. Data Minimization by Design</h2>
        <p>CryptoPulse champions privacy. We do not sell your personal data to third parties. We collect minimal telemetry strictly necessary to deliver fast, secure, and reliable news services to your browser.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white">2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>We may collect information you voluntarily provide, such as your email address when subscribing to the CryptoPulse Daily Dispatch newsletter or contacting our editorial tip line. Standard server log data (IP address, browser type, referring pages) is collected automatically for DDoS mitigation and performance caching.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white">3. Your GDPR & CCPA Rights</h2>
        <p>Under GDPR and CCPA, you have the right to request access to your data, request deletion of your email from our records, or restrict processing. Inquiries can be sent to <code>privacy@cryptopulse.news</code>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>